sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Frontend
    participant APIGateway
    participant KYCService
    actor Admin

    Admin->>Frontend: Request Additional KYC Docs
    Frontend->>APIGateway: POST /api/admin/kyc-additional-requests
    APIGateway->>KYCService: Forward Request
    KYCService-->>Frontend: Success Response
    
    Frontend->>User: Display Notification (Popup)
    User->>Frontend: Upload Document Image
    Frontend->>APIGateway: POST /api/kyc/requests/:id/upload
    APIGateway->>KYCService: Handle Upload
    KYCService-->>Frontend: Upload Success
    
    Frontend->>Admin: Send Notification (Document Uploaded)
